## 📋 Available commands

### Atomic stages (6)

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `{{ cmd }}research` | Gather context, prior art, library docs |
| `{{ cmd }}spec`     | Lock acceptance criteria (intent / outcomes / scenarios) |
| `{{ cmd }}execute`  | TDD machine — RED → GREEN per PLAN phase |
| `{{ cmd }}review`   | Multi-reviewer consensus + grade gate + auto-fix |
| `{{ cmd }}wrapup`   | Single commit, CHANGELOG, doc updates |
| `{{ cmd }}verify`   | Independent pre-wrapup invariant checks |

